      "review_description": "Matt the owner was professional, on time and courteous throughout the entire process. His quote came back very competitive with multiple options based on what we were looking for.This professionalism extended to the install - Matt and his staff were professional and when they left you would not know they had been there as there wasn't a skerrick of waste left behind - just a very clean solar install.After the install Matt was helpful in showing me how the app worked and how to get the most out of our system. He checked in regularly both remotely and in person in the following weeks to make sure the system was operating as expected.All in all incredibly happy with the whole process, we highly recommend Matt and his staff.",
